# Purpose
Explains how to capture, source, write, and group feedback so it can be acted
on.

# Key Sections
- When to use this guide.
- Capture feedback in one place.
- Record the source.
- Write feedback as a clear item.
- Group related feedback.

# Dependencies
- Belongs to the productivity manual set.

# Gotchas
- Preserve the difference between user feedback, interpretation, and planned
  action.

# Change History
- 2026-08-03: Added ACE companion.
